      "description": "Note: You can easily convert this markdown file to a PDF in VSCode using this handy extension Markdown PDF.\nBack to the Top\nDigital Signal Processing (DSP) is the application of a digital computer to modify an analog or digital signal. It's wadely used in many applications including video/audio/data communications and networking, medical imaging and computer vision, speech synthesis and coding, digital audio and video, and control of complex systems and industrial processes.\nLearn Digital Signal Processing (DSP) | Udemy\nDigital Signal Processing (DSP) From Ground Up™ in C | Udemy\nDigital Signal Processing Courses | Coursera\nDSP - Digital Signal Processing - Intel® FPGA\nDigital Signal Processing | Stanford Online\nDigital Signal Processing | UC San Diego Extension\nDigital Signal Processing I Courses Online | Purdue\nDigital Signal Processing | MIT OpenCourseWare\nCreative Digital Signal Processing (DSP) for Music and Visuals\nDigital Signal Processing Course | Prosoundtraining",
